}}'''Festive''' was a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Chroma Box]]. Festive was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] redesigned the [[Chroma Box]] into the [[Rainbow Box]].

==Appearance==
Its blade is neon green, and the guard is white. The handle is bright red.

==Trivia==
*Its original design was [[Dew]].
*This, along with the other knives from the [[Chroma Box]], was removed from all players’ [[Inventory|inventories]].
